{
 "id": "seg5",
 "title": "拉开距离",
 "pill": 5,
 "total": 118.01,
 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg5-00",
   "text": "防御分两头，一头降低暴露，一头降低胁迫的收益。",
   "spoken": "防御分两头，一头降低暴露，一头降低胁迫的收益。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep22/audio/lines/seg5-00.mp3",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 4.92,
   "speechStart": 1.698,
   "speechEnd": 5.674
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-01",
   "text": "降低暴露，先管住嘴，不公开谈持仓，不晒资产截图。",
   "spoken": "降低暴露，先管住嘴，不公开谈持仓，不晒资产截图。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep22/audio/lines/seg5-01.mp3",
   "start": 6.74,
   "dur": 5.424,
   "speechStart": 6.838,
   "speechEnd": 11.314
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-02",
   "text": "链上身份和真实身份分开，公开收款地址和个人大额地址，不用同一个。",
   "spoken": "链上身份和真实身份分开，公开收款地址和个人大额地址，不用同一个。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep22/audio/lines/seg5-02.mp3",
   "start": 12.384,
   "dur": 6.72,
   "speechStart": 12.482,
   "speechEnd": 18.279
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-03",
   "text": "硬件钱包这类订单，用代收地址或者公司地址收货。",
   "spoken": "硬件钱包这类订单，用代收地址或者公司地址收货。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep22/audio/lines/seg5-03.mp3",
   "start": 19.324,
   "dur": 5.232,
   "speechStart": 19.422,
   "speechEnd": 23.707
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-04",
   "text": "照片里不要拍到住址、车牌和日常路线。",
   "spoken": "照片里不要拍到住址、车牌和日常路线。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep22/audio/lines/seg5-04.mp3",
   "start": 24.776,
   "dur": 4.464,
   "speechStart": 24.874,
   "speechEnd": 28.385
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-05",
   "text": "定期搜一搜自己的姓名和住址，去数据经纪网站申请删除。",
   "spoken": "定期搜一搜自己的姓名和住址，去数据经纪网站申请删除。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep22/audio/lines/seg5-05.mp3",
   "start": 29.46,
   "dur": 5.544,
   "speechStart": 29.558,
   "speechEnd": 34.165
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-06",
   "text": "降低胁迫的收益，靠的是让本人确实转不出去。",
   "spoken": "降低胁迫的收益，靠的是让本人确实转不出去。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep22/audio/lines/seg5-06.mp3",
   "start": 35.224,
   "dur": 4.368,
   "speechStart": 35.322,
   "speechEnd": 38.75
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-07",
   "text": "大额资产放进多签或者时间锁，转出要异地的另一个人，或者另一台设备。",
   "spoken": "大额资产放进多签或者时间锁，转出要异地的另一个人，或者另一台设备。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep22/audio/lines/seg5-07.mp3",
   "start": 39.812,
   "dur": 6.528,
   "speechStart": 39.91,
   "speechEnd": 45.493
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-08",
   "text": "随身的设备，只放少量资产。",
   "spoken": "随身的设备，只放少量资产。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep22/audio/lines/seg5-08.mp3",
   "start": 46.56,
   "dur": 3.408,
   "speechStart": 46.658,
   "speechEnd": 49.122
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-09",
   "text": "和家人约定胁迫暗号，还有紧急联系的流程。",
   "spoken": "和家人约定胁迫暗号，还有紧急联系的流程。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep22/audio/lines/seg5-09.mp3",
   "start": 50.188,
   "dur": 4.32,
   "speechStart": 50.286,
   "speechEnd": 53.655
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-10",
   "text": "要说清楚，多签和时间锁，降低的是立即转出的可能，不能保证人身安全。",
   "spoken": "要说清楚，多签和时间锁，降低的是立即转出的可能，不能保证人身安全。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep22/audio/lines/seg5-10.mp3",
   "start": 54.728,
   "dur": 6.768,
   "speechStart": 54.826,
   "speechEnd": 60.647
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-11",
   "text": "劫匪对转不出的反应，难以预测，人身安全第一，资产第二。",
   "spoken": "劫匪对转不出的反应，难以预测，人身安全第一，资产第二。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep22/audio/lines/seg5-11.mp3",
   "start": 61.716,
   "dur": 5.952,
   "speechStart": 61.814,
   "speechEnd": 66.837
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-12",
   "text": "账号这边，邮箱、交易所、社交账号、域名注册商，都用硬件安全密钥，做多因素认证。",
   "spoken": "账号这边，邮箱、交易所、社交账号、域名注册商，都用硬件安全密钥，做多因素认证。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep22/audio/lines/seg5-12.mp3",
   "start": 67.888,
   "dur": 8.4,
   "speechStart": 67.986,
   "speechEnd": 75.45
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-13",
   "text": "不用短信做多因素认证，也不用它恢复密码。",
   "spoken": "不用短信做多因素认证，也不用它恢复密码。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep22/audio/lines/seg5-13.mp3",
   "start": 76.508,
   "dur": 4.032,
   "speechStart": 76.606,
   "speechEnd": 79.689
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-14",
   "text": "向运营商申请号码转移锁，或者 SIM 更换 PIN。",
   "spoken": "向运营商申请号码转移锁，或者 SIM 更换 PIN。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep22/audio/lines/seg5-14.mp3",
   "start": 80.76,
   "dur": 4.68,
   "speechStart": 80.858,
   "speechEnd": 84.608
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-15",
   "text": "关键账号，用不公开的专用邮箱注册。",
   "spoken": "关键账号，用不公开的专用邮箱注册。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep22/audio/lines/seg5-15.mp3",
   "start": 85.66,
   "dur": 3.84,
   "speechStart": 85.758,
   "speechEnd": 88.65
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-16",
   "text": "项目方还要多做几件事。",
   "spoken": "项目方还要多做几件事。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep22/audio/lines/seg5-16.mp3",
   "start": 89.72,
   "dur": 2.832,
   "speechStart": 89.818,
   "speechEnd": 91.722
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-17",
   "text": "列出关键人员，创始人、多签签名人、运维负责人、官方账号管理员。",
   "spoken": "列出关键人员，创始人、多签签名人、运维负责人、官方账号管理员。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep22/audio/lines/seg5-17.mp3",
   "start": 92.772,
   "dur": 6.816,
   "speechStart": 92.87,
   "speechEnd": 98.739
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-18",
   "text": "签名人名单不公开，必要时只公开机构。",
   "spoken": "签名人名单不公开，必要时只公开机构。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep22/audio/lines/seg5-18.mp3",
   "start": 99.808,
   "dur": 4.032,
   "speechStart": 99.906,
   "speechEnd": 103.001
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-19",
   "text": "官方账号交接时，不关闭多因素认证，发帖权限和恢复权限分开。",
   "spoken": "官方账号交接时，不关闭多因素认证，发帖权限和恢复权限分开。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep22/audio/lines/seg5-19.mp3",
   "start": 104.06,
   "dur": 6.312,
   "speechStart": 104.158,
   "speechEnd": 109.539
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-20",
   "text": "再备好被盗预案，备用公告渠道、平台联系人、写好的辟谣声明。",
   "spoken": "再备好被盗预案，备用公告渠道、平台联系人、写好的辟谣声明。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep22/audio/lines/seg5-20.mp3",
   "start": 110.592,
   "dur": 6.216,
   "speechStart": 110.69,
   "speechEnd": 115.963
  }
